# Toon Ranks Mobile — Cursor Rules

## Project identity
Expo 54 / React Native 0.81 native app (TypeScript) for the Toon Ranks manga/manhwa/manhua
ranking platform. Shares the production backend and user data with the website.
React Navigation, TanStack Query, Axios, expo-secure-store.

## Hard rules
- **Read CONSTRAINTS.md and AGENTS.md** — they define the workflow, handoff, and product rules
- Never commit or push without explicit instruction from the owner
- Always end every task with: numbered emulator/device test steps (with expected outcomes) + one-line commit message + short PR description
- Never work on `main` — branch as `mobile-<short-desc>`
- Run `npm run verify` (typecheck + lint + format + test) before handing back
- Bump the app version ONLY when the owner says they ran / are running a build — never on merge or handoff. No OTA, so Play needs a new build with a higher `versionCode`. `app.json` may already be one ahead of the live build (staged bump); if so don't bump again. When triggered, bump `android.versionCode` (+1), `ios.buildNumber` (+1), `version` (semver) — see CONSTRAINTS.md #7

## Architecture rules
- API calls go through `src/api/` wrappers — never call axios directly from a screen
- Tokens use `expo-secure-store` — never plain AsyncStorage (AsyncStorage ok for non-sensitive drafts)
- Shared backend only — never add a mobile-only store for data that must sync with the website
  (reading lists, forum, votes, identity)
- Auth changes: `docs/MOBILE_AUTH_CONTRACT.md` is the source of truth — read before editing auth
- Use theme tokens in `src/theme/` — never hardcode colors/spacing; styles built per-screen via getStyles()
- It is NOT a web wrapper — preserve the product model, not the website layout; no web-page copy

## Domain vocabulary
- Series types: MANGA, MANHWA, MANHUA
- Series statuses: ONGOING, COMPLETE, HIATUS, SEASON_END, UNKNOWN
- User roles: GENERAL < CONTRIBUTOR < ADMIN
- Scoring: 1-10 per category; final_score = avg of the category averages

## Key reference files
- Quick start: CLAUDE.md
- Full product context + roadmap: AGENTS.md
- App structure: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
- Auth: docs/MOBILE_AUTH_CONTRACT.md
- Active roadmap: docs/CORE_APP_EXPERIENCE_TODO.md

## What to avoid
- Committing/pushing without being asked
- Calling axios directly from screens
- Storing tokens in AsyncStorage
- Hardcoding colors/spacing instead of theme tokens
- Mobile-only data stores for shared data
- Large one-off screen rewrites when a reusable component fits
